#. Replace a device, as a step in the in-app form (SIGN-IN.md §3.7). Arguments: {thisDevice} = the platform phrase for the current device (part.thisDevice).
msgid "signin.replace.lede"
msgstr "로그아웃할 기기를 선택하세요. {thisDevice}이(가) 대신 사용돼요."

