#. PX-14a: the app card (SIGN-IN.md §3.6 to §3.9).
msgid "signin.key.upgradeLede"
msgstr "계정에 보관하면 다시 받거나 새 기기로 직접 옮길 수 있어요."

#. Create account
#. PX-14a: the app card (SIGN-IN.md §3.6 to §3.9).
msgid "signin.key.createAccount"
msgstr "계정 만들기"

#. macos: Create Account
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.key.createAccount"
msgstr "계정 만들기"

#. Sign in instead
#. PX-14a: the app card (SIGN-IN.md §3.6 to §3.9).
msgid "signin.key.signInInstead"
msgstr "대신 로그인"

#. macos: Sign In Instead
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "signin.key.signInInstead"
msgstr "대신 로그인"

