msgstr "두 계정에 다시 로그인한 뒤 합치세요."

#. One account was joined in the last 72 hours. Try again after that.
#. Link dialog: an account was joined in the last 72 hours.
msgid "signin.join.reasonPending"
msgstr "최근 72시간 안에 합친 계정이 있어요. 72시간이 지난 후 다시 시도하세요."

#. Cancel the scheduled deletion first, then join.
#. Link dialog: a scheduled deletion blocks the join.
